('C177', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>You should complete <a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/ai-powered-quantitative-trading-fundamentals.html" title="AI Powered Quantitative Trading Fundamentals">AI Powered Quantitative Trading Fundamentals (C728)</a> before taking this course. C728 demonstrates the multi AI agents trading system and the indicators, backtesting and paper trading it relies on; this course teaches you to build it from scratch.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p><ul><li>Able to operate using computer functions</li><li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li></ul><p>Attitude</p><ul><li>Positive Learning Attitude</li><li>Enthusiastic Learner</li></ul><p>Experience</p><ul><li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li></ul><p>Target Age Group: 21-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You will need the following for this course:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://www.python.org/downloads/" target="_blank">Python 3.11 or later</a> &ndash; free</li>\n<li><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/download" target="_blank">Visual Studio Code</a> &ndash; free</li>\n<li><a href="https://git-scm.com/downloads" target="_blank">Git</a> and a <a href="https://github.com/signup" target="_blank">GitHub</a> account &ndash; free</li>\n<li>An AI coding assistant &ndash; <a href="https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" target="_blank">GitHub Copilot Free</a> in Visual Studio Code works; Claude Code or OpenAI Codex if you already use one</li>\n<li>Optional free API keys for the live labs: <a href="https://twelvedata.com/" target="_blank">Twelve Data</a>, <a href="https://equibles.com/" target="_blank">Equibles</a>, <a href="https://newsapi.org/" target="_blank">NewsAPI</a>, a <a href="https://www.reddit.com/prefs/apps" target="_blank">Reddit</a> script app and an <a href="https://alpaca.markets/" target="_blank">Alpaca</a> paper-trading account &ndash; every lab also runs offline on sample data</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows PC or Mac laptop</p>\n', '020831b0c70a68ac751a3d83b9558808', ''),
