('C522', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This is an intermediate course. the following basic knowledge is assumed</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/r-statistics-training-data-analytics.html" title="R Programming Course" target="_blank">R Programming</a></li>\n<li><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/bioinformatics-courses-singapore.html" title="Bioinformatics Courses" target="_blank">Bioinformatics</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p>Please download and install the following software prior to the class</p>\n<ul>\n<li>R&nbsp;<a href="https://cran.r-project.org/" title="R Download" target="_blank">https://cran.r-project.org</a>/</li>\n<li>R Studio&nbsp;<a href="https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/" title="R Studio Download" target="_blank">https://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/</a></li>\n</ul>\n', '9f0838104a891147dfbc1092483f8b11', ''),
('C523', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course is for beginners. No prerequisite is required.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You will need the following for this course:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A web browser such as Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge or Safari &ndash; free</li>\n<li>Access to the course materials provided in class</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows PC or Mac laptop</p>\n<h2>External Certification</h2>\n<p><span><span>The participant will be able to attempt the Project Management Professional (PMP) exam after attending this course. Upon passing the exam, you will receive the Project Management Professional (PMP) accreditation. This certification validates their project management skills, knowledge, and experience. PMP certification enhances career prospects by demonstrating proficiency in project management processes and tools, globally recognized and respected within the industry.</span></span></p>\n<h2>Project Management Professional Exam Fee</h2>\n<p><span lang="EN-GB">The course fees do not cover the cost of the PMI&rsquo;s Project Management Professional (PMP) exam voucher. Those interested in taking the exam need to purchase their own voucher, which is available for purchase via the links below.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><span><span><span lang="EN-GB"><span>PMP&reg; Exam&nbsp;</span></span></span><span>Voucher:&nbsp;</span><span>PMI member&nbsp;</span>$663.70 (inclusive of 9% GST),&nbsp;<span>Non-PMI member&nbsp;</span><span>$931.95&nbsp;</span>(inclusive of 9% GST)</span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Exam duration:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>3 Hour 50 Mins</span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Exam format:</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span><span><span><span>About 180 Multiple Choice questions.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can purchase the PMP exam below</p>\n<table border="2" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" class="Table" style="width: 595px;">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan="4" nowrap="nowrap">\n<p align="center"><span><span><span><span lang="EN-US">Exam Fee&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span><span>before GST</span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span><span>after GST</span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>PMI member Exam Fee</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span>$608.90</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span>$663.70</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="https://www.ntuclearninghub.com/p/project-management-professional-pmp-%C2%AE-exam-pmi-member-"><span lang="EN-US">Buy now</span></a></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span>Non-PMI member Exam Fee</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span>$855.00</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span>$931.95</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p align="center"><span><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="https://www.ntuclearninghub.com/p/project-management-professional-pmp-%C2%AE-exam-pmi-non-member"><span lang="EN-US">Buy now</span></a></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>Remarks</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>It''s important to check PMI''s official website or contact PMI directly for the most current and accurate information regarding the format and passing marks for the PMP exam, as these details may have changed.</li>\n<li>Trainee must complete the course with at least 90% attendance.</li>\n<li>Trainee must fulfil the PMP exam criteria.</li>\n<li>Trainee must submit credentials to PMI to apply for the PMP exam.</li>\n<li>Upon passing the official PMP certification exam, trainee will receive a Project Management Professional certification from PMI.</li>\n<li>Note that the certification is governed and maintained by the Project Management Institute.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><span>Find out more information about the&nbsp;<span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.pmi.org/certifications/project-management-pmp" target="_blank">Project Management Professional exam</a></span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">.</span></span></span></p>\n', '57b3649cccc36b77f9a9d423e0c20dd6', ''),
