('C789', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Basic Blockchain knowledge</li>\n<li>Good to have basic Python knowledge</li>\n<li>Good to have basic Javascript knowledge</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Download and Install <a href="https://www.trufflesuite.com/ganache" title="Ganache" target="_blank">Ganache</a></li>\n<li>Download and Install <a href="https://www.trufflesuite.com/" title="Trulle" target="_blank">Truffle</a></li>\n<li>Create a free account with <a href="https://infura.io/" title="Infuria" target="_blank">Infuria</a></li>\n<li>Download and install <a href="https://nodejs.org/en/" title="node.js" target="_blank">Node.js</a></li>\n<li>Download and Install <a href="https://www.python.org/" title="Python" target="_blank">Python</a></li>\n</ul>\n', '9af0f882bac520452f0fdd543ba274c7', ''),
