('C830', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course is for beginners. No prerequisite is required.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Download and install Qlik Sense&reg; Desktop;<a href="https://www.qlik.com/us/try-or-buy/download-qlik-sense" title="Qlik Sense&reg; Desktop" target="_blank"></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong>&nbsp;Window or&nbsp;Mac&nbsp;Laptops</p>\n', 'a3eeb41640c586b7980dcd4682836a02', ''),
('C831', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course is for beginners. No prerequisite is required.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p><ul><li>Able to operate using computer functions</li><li>Minimum 3 GCE ‘O’ Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li></ul><p>Attitude</p><ul><li>Positive Learning Attitude</li><li>Enthusiastic Learner</li></ul><p>Experience</p><ul><li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li></ul><p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You will need the following for this course:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A free account on a generative AI assistant of your choice, e.g. <a href="https://chatgpt.com/" target="_blank">ChatGPT</a>, <a href="https://gemini.google.com/" target="_blank">Google Gemini</a> or <a href="https://copilot.microsoft.com/" target="_blank">Microsoft Copilot</a> (the free tier is sufficient)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows PC or Mac laptop</p>\n', '8bdc517a144f6abc14b301857fd78eff', ''),
