('C840', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course is for beginners. No prerequisite is required.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 21-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You can download and install the following software:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>An agentic AI builder or assistant (Claude, ChatGPT or Microsoft Copilot &mdash; the free tier is sufficient)</li>\n<li><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.python.org/downloads/" target="_blank">Python 3</a></span> (to run the activity verifiers)</li>\n<li><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/download" target="_blank">Visual Studio Code</a></span> or another text editor for YAML, JSON and Markdown files</li>\n<li>A spreadsheet (Excel, Numbers or Google Sheets)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows or Mac laptop with administrator rights to install software</p>\n', 'e93e37fbf88735036106855e0be5ef2d', ''),
('C841', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course is for beginners. No prerequisite is required.</p>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You will need the following for this course:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://nodejs.org/en/download" target="_blank">Node.js (LTS)</a> &ndash; free</li>\n<li><a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/download" target="_blank">Visual Studio Code</a> &ndash; free</li>\n<li>An AI coding assistant with a free tier, e.g. <a href="https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" target="_blank">GitHub Copilot Free</a> in Visual Studio Code</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows PC or Mac laptop</p>\n', '0cbee3053c4f252cc72221332fcc74fc', ''),
('C842', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This is an intermediate course. The following knowledge is assumed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/basic-python-training-for-beginners.html" title="python training" target="_blank">Basic Python</a></li>\n<li><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/deep-learning-with-keras.html" title="Basic Keras Training" target="_blank">Basic Keras</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p>Please install the following software prior to the class</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Pycharm :&nbsp; Install Pycharm (<a href="https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/download/" target="_blank">https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/download/</a>)</li>\n<li>Install Tensorflow on Mac</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Please follow this guide to install Tensorflow on Mac&nbsp;h<a href="ttps://www.tensorflow.org/install/install_mac" target="_blank">ttps://www.tensorflow.org/install/install_mac</a></p>\n<p>Please follow this guide to install Tensorflow on Window <a href="https://www.tensorflow.org/install/install_windows" target="_blank">https://www.tensorflow.org/install/install_windows</a></p>\n', 'a95f90c7c0d4378bf086ebea0e1a52df', ''),
('C851', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This is a intermediate level course. The following prerequisite is assumed</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://www.tertiarycourses.com.sg/basic-python-training-for-beginners.html" title="Basic Python Training" target="_blank">Basic Python</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p>Please download and install the following software prior to the class</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Python 3.x <a href="https://www.python.org/downloads/" title="Python 3" target="_blank">https://www.python.org/downloads/</a></li>\n<li>Sublime Text 3 <a href="https://www.sublimetext.com/3" title="Sublime Text 3" target="_blank">https://www.sublimetext.com/3</a></li>\n<li>Pycharm <a href="https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/download/" title="Pycharm" target="_blank">https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/download/</a></li>\n</ul>\n', 'eed0f348278417d04f516c52043bda4c', ''),
('C852', '<h2>Prerequisite</h2>\n<p>This course assumes the following:</p><ul><li>Basic computer literacy</li><li>No prior IoT or programming experience required</li></ul>\n<h2>Minimum Entry Requirement</h2>\n<p>Knowledge and Skills</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Able to operate using computer functions</li>\n<li>Minimum 3 GCE &lsquo;O&rsquo; Levels Passes including English or WPL Level 5 (Average of Reading, Listening, Speaking &amp; Writing Scores)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Attitude</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Positive Learning Attitude</li>\n<li>Enthusiastic Learner</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Experience</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum of 1 year of working experience.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Target Age Group: 18-65 years old</p>\n<h2>Minimum Software/Hardware Requirement</h2>\n<p><strong>Software:</strong></p>\n<p>You will need the following for this course:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href="https://www.arduino.cc/en/software" target="_blank">Arduino IDE</a> &ndash; free</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Hardware:</strong> Windows PC or Mac laptop</p>\n', 'e13e8b273a8c30c8bb92014870c49248', ''),
